# tally 2.1.8 R13.1 (item 2, left by the follow-up; the review of group 1's a4_d texts): a diff whose worlds sit on
# two stacks, sc and sd over pw, under windows each. Each side runs once per choice of its windows' days; the
# runs are paired that take the same day of every window both meet (e1: dj, three pairs, not nine), and the pairs
# print one block per run of sub-windows that agree, as the pins e2, e3 do; e4's answer is the same on every day
# of dk[a], which both meet, so it is one block, its register the read set of all its days (pick P34); e5's se
# states dj, so only sc's runs take it. 9762e319..c669fbc9 ignored the clause and printed
# the plain line.
=== m.tally
model pw
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-25
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index ks = [a, b]
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place jar[k in ks]: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
input amt: money PLN
input dk[k in ks]: date
input dj: date
input dd: int
input d0: date
input amt2: money PLN

move one[k in ks]: transfers
  on dk[k]
  at d0
  leg cash from world to jar[k] amount amt

move two: transfers
  on dj
  at d0
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt2

move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dd)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN "s"
  dk[a] = window(2026-03-01, 2026-03-10) "s"
  dk[b] = 2026-03-05 "s"
  amt2 = 5.00 PLN "s"
  dd = 10 "s"
  d0 = 2026-01-01 "s"
  dj = window(2026-03-02, 2026-03-04) "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[jar[a]] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[jar[b]] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask e1: diff(bal(konto, 2026-03-03)) in sd against sc windows each
ask e4: diff(bal(jar[k], 2026-03-05) for k in ks) in sd against sc windows each
ask e2: diff(bal(konto, 2026-03-03)) in sd against sc with dj = 2026-03-02
ask e3: diff(bal(konto, 2026-03-03)) in sd against sc with dj = 2026-03-04
ask e5: diff(bal(konto, 2026-03-03)) in se against sc windows each
=== sc.tally
scenario sc over pw
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01

version sc_v
  cite s
  governs 2026-01-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  replace amt2 = 7.00 PLN "s"
=== sd.tally
scenario sd over pw
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01

version sd_v
  cite s
  governs 2026-01-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  replace dk[b] = 2026-03-07 "s"
=== se.tally
scenario se over pw
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01

version se_v
  cite s
  governs 2026-01-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  replace amt2 = 6.00 PLN "s"
  replace dj = 2026-03-03 "s"
=== expect
e1 [dj = 2026-03-02 .. 2026-03-03]: diff in sd against sc: 1 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  changed bal(konto, 2026-03-03): 25.00 PLN against 27.00 PLN
  world: sc
  world: sd
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: two
  cut 2026-04-25
e1 [dj = 2026-03-04]: diff in sd against sc: 0 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 1 unchanged
  world: sc
  world: sd
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  cut 2026-04-25
e2: diff in sd against sc: 1 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  changed bal(konto, 2026-03-03): 25.00 PLN against 27.00 PLN
  pinned: dj = 2026-03-02
  world: sc
  world: sd
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: two
  cut 2026-04-25
e3: diff in sd against sc: 0 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 1 unchanged
  pinned: dj = 2026-03-04
  world: sc
  world: sd
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  cut 2026-04-25
e4: diff in sd against sc: 1 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 1 unchanged
  changed (k = b): 0.00 PLN against 10.00 PLN
  world: sc
  world: sd
  unfulfilled: one[a]
  unfulfilled: one[b]
  cut 2026-04-25
e5 [dj = 2026-03-02 .. 2026-03-03]: diff in se against sc: 1 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  changed bal(konto, 2026-03-03): 26.00 PLN against 27.00 PLN
  world: sc
  world: se
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: two
  cut 2026-04-25
e5 [dj = 2026-03-04]: diff in se against sc: 1 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  changed bal(konto, 2026-03-03): 26.00 PLN against 20.00 PLN
  world: sc
  world: se
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: two
  cut 2026-04-25
